WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.650
A key asks two-way questions about features you can see, one at a time.

2
00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:09.876
Answer each question about the specimen in front of you, one at a time.

3
00:00:10.681 --> 00:00:12.956
Does it have a backbone? Yes.

4
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.165
Does it have feathers? No, it has fur.

5
00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:24.402
Each answer leads on to a name; one wrong answer gives the wrong name.
